### Direction B — Mobile WatermelonDB DTR Phase 1 (single-item T3+ batch, ~60-80K)
Same as previous .whatsnext. Offline DTR sync for technicians; pair with backend sync
endpoints. May overflow single session — consider Architect-Execute split (§4
memory-governance.md).

### Direction C — Small carry-forward bundle (2-3 items, ~20-30K combined)
